<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Halla to build 34-story Cairo building.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Halla to build 34-story Cairo building.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Halla Group said on Wednesday it has agreed to construct a 34-storey building in Cairo in a joint venture with Egyptian contractor Talaat Mostafa Group.</p>
<p>A Halla spokesman said Halla signed a memorandum of understanding with Talaat on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He said details of the deal would be further negotiated until the contract was signed.</p>
<p>Construction of the twin-tower building is expected to begin in early 1997 with completion for 2000.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
